  "tip": "<p>When a question asks for spreading reads across Cloud SQL replicas with minimal code change look for a database aware proxy that can do <i>read write split</i> and <i>connection pooling</i>. Remember that Google Cloud load balancers cannot sit in front of <i>Cloud SQL</i> instances.</p>",
